# Product lead

For creating/updating `plans/**`, syncing umbrella issue checklists, or
reporting multi-repo requirement status:

1. Delegate to subagent `product-lead` (see `.cursor/TEAM.md`)
2. Load skill `.agents/skills/product-lead/SKILL.md`
3. Progress = hub **GitHub issue** only — never `PROGRESS.md`
4. Publish a **Work Contract** (branch + ownership) then parallel
   `dev`+`test`+`devops`; snap; then `review` — see `docs/agents/parallel-wave.md`

New/unclear intake → `requirement-triage` first.
